  "extensions": {
    "story": "## Purpose\n\nMember **directory read model** — one row per `hwy_members.id` with COALESCE from `base_user_profiles` and joined nakhebin geo titles. Lists, queues, and Data API list/getOne use this view — not the raw table alone.\n\n## Rules\n\n- Column order in Studio follows **Keys → platform account → Arabic identity → contact → profile media → lineage → address → nakhebin → membership → referrer → education → employment → operator → audit**.\n- Same group names as `hwy_members` where the field maps 1:1; extra groups **Platform account** and **Profile media** for login/profile surfaces.\n- `tracking_code` is always the member id string for public search — not the التياري username.",
    "scenarioIds": [
      "S1",
      "S2",
      "S3",
      "S4",
      "S6",
      "S7"
    ],
